        <mxCell id="p1" value="PHASE 1 — Refactoring foundation&#10;&#10;• Python 2 → Python 3 port (PR #1)&#10;• Group picks Go (Leo + Claude weekend port)&#10;• PR #15: full Go rewrite, 4 tests&#10;• Multi-stage Dockerfile + Alpine&#10;• v1.0.0 tagged (Feb 12)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D6EAF8;strokeColor=#2E86AB;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
