        <mxCell id="p2" value="PHASE 2 — Single-VM + CI/CD&#10;&#10;• Vagrantfile for Hetzner Cloud&#10;• Hetzner droplet live Feb 18 (SQLite&#10;  on Docker volume, one VM all-in-one)&#10;• Simulator API + Swagger&#10;• GitHub Actions CI (Feb 24)&#10;• CD: ghcr.io + SSH deploy (Mar 6)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EAECEE;strokeColor=#5C6B73;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
