        <mxCell id="p3" value="PHASE 3 — Data + monitoring&#10;&#10;• GORM ORM (no more raw SQL)&#10;• v1.1.0 tagged (Mar 6) — last tag&#10;• Hetzner Volume considered, dropped&#10;• PR #79: SQLite → DO managed PG&#10;• Prom + Grafana wired (Mar 18)&#10;• Custom HTTP metrics middleware" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D6EAF8;strokeColor=#2E86AB;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
