        <mxCell id="p5" value="PHASE 5 — Swarm + TLS&#10;&#10;• PR #120: 3-node DO Swarm (Apr 10)&#10;• Manager + 2 workers, 3 webserver&#10;  replicas, spread placement&#10;• Traefik + Let's Encrypt (Apr 10)&#10;• Parallel run with Hetzner begins&#10;• Three alert rules in Prometheus" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EAECEE;strokeColor=#5C6B73;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
