        <mxCell id="p7" value="PHASE 7 — Endgame&#10;&#10;• Container hardening: multi-stage build, non-root user, Docker Scout (PR #143–#160)&#10;• Codacy enabled (PR #163, May 4) — already caught a real bug (commit c8ff76c)&#10;• Personal timeline 234s → 5.7s (a3dfc3d, LATERAL join, May 1)&#10;• PR #162: Hetzner step removed from CD (May 4)&#10;• PR #167: Terraform — cluster declaratively (May 12)&#10;• PR #168: Playwright browser-UI tests in CI&#10;• May 15: Hetzner droplet deleted, end of single-server era&#10;• Report drafted, exam prep" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F5E9;strokeColor=#2A9D8F;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
